   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "Inside the kitchen, Nastya is very worried about breaking the Chef's car mirror earlier. Kostya wants their date to happen, so he offers a brave sacrifice. Let's hear them in Russian.",
   "gap": 0.8
  },
  {
