   "t": "Шеф опять с ней ругается.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'The boss is arguing with her again.' -- Nastya looks out the window in absolute terror.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Да ладно, Настя, всё образуется.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Come on, Nastya, everything will work out.' -- The bartender tries to calm his panicked girlfriend.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "Сегодня у нас тоже ничего не получится?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Things won't work out for us today either?' -- She assumes their romantic evening is totally ruined.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Нет, Настя, ну ты просто обещала.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'No, Nastya, you simply promised.' -- Kostya refuses to accept another cancelled dinner date.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Хочешь, я пойду к шефу?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do you want me to go to the boss?' -- He suggests a very dangerous rescue plan.",
   "gap": 0.4
