  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я скажу, что это я сломал зеркало.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I will say that I broke the mirror.' -- He offers to take the terrible blame himself.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
