   "t": "Не надо, он тебя уволит.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Do not do it, he will fire you.' -- Nastya begs him to protect his own job.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "anya",
   "t": "Я сказал, значит, я пойду.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'I said it, which means I will go.' -- The determined bartender ignores her desperate warnings.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "Костик, подожди, не ходи.",
   "gap": 0.55
